00:52:12,000 --> 00:52:18,000
Rush is a 2013 biographical sports film directed by
Ron Howard and written by Peter Morgan.

10
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:06,000
It is centred on the rivalry between two Formula One drivers, James
Hunt and Niki Lauda, during the 1976 Formula One season.

11
01:03:48,000 --> 01:03:54,000
The film stars Chris Hemsworth as Hunt and Daniel Brühl as Lauda.

12
01:09:36,000 --> 01:09:42,000
The film premiered in London on 2 September 2013 and was shown at the 2013 Toronto
International Film Festival before its United Kingdom release on 13 September 2013.

13
01:15:24,000 --> 01:15:30,000
The film received positive reviews from critics for Hemsworth and Brühl's performances,
Howard's direction, the racing sequences, and Hans Zimmer's musical score.

14
01:21:12,000 --> 01:21:18,000
The tone is lighthearted.
